            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "In a world where all cars are autonomous, the ability to optimize the flow of traffic and reroute vehicles dependent on other cars destinations is crucial. Our project enables all cars to communicate and figure out the most efficient way to get each independent car from A to B in the quickest way possible. Coordination and teamwork leads to better outcome for all.",
